          %h2#prequantum_gauge_theory_and_gravity Prequantum gauge theory and gravity
          %p
            In the previous chapters we have set up
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/prequantum+field+theory"} prequantum field theory
            and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/classical+field+theory"} classical field theory
            in generality. Here we discuss examples of such
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/field+%28physics%29"} field
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/theory+%28physics%29"} theories
            in more detail.
          %div
