            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/unitary+matrix"} unitary matrix
            to its
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/determinant"} determinant
          %p
            Being a Lie group homomorphism, this induces a map of
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/deloopings"} deloopings
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/moduli+stacks"} moduli stacks
          .maruku-equation
