              of
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                      %mi J
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbf{J}
              along the point inclusion by the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/factorization+lemma"} factorization lemma
              as discussed at
              = succeed "." do
                %em
                  %a{:href => "homotopy%20pullback#ConstructionsGeneral"} homotopy pullback – Constructions
            %p
              This says that with
