            %p
              for the differential smooth universal Dixmier-Douady class of prop.
              = succeed "," do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#DifferentialRefinementOfSMoothDDClass"}
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/slice+%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-topos"} slice (∞,1)-topos
              over
