                    %mi Σ
                    %mn 2
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \coprod_i {*} \to \Sigma_2
            be the inclusion of points, thought of as the punctures of the Wilson line above through this slice. Then we have
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/prequantum+bundles"} prequantum bundles
            given by
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/transgression"} transgression
            of the extended Lagrangians to codimension 1
